      "content": "Your feelings of asking \"why am I still fighting\" are valid proofs of your deep commitment, yet acknowledging these limits is a natural next step toward finding sustainable dignity in your work. It is important to remember that your presence offers a specific type of dignity and humanity that cannot be outsourced, even if the system around you cannot always provide it. Please prioritize your own well-being tonight by resting fully, separating the role you put on at work from your identity as a human being who deserves rest.",
